{"seq":8,"slug":"rf-antenna-design","title":"射频与天线设计","stage":"DONE","category":"hardware-electronics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 射频与天线设计\n\n射频工程的难点不在某个公式，而在于一种思维的切换：当频率升高到波长可与电路尺寸相比拟，导线不再是简单连接，能量开始以波的形态在系统里流动、反射、辐射。这本 hub 沿着「能量从信号源出发、被处理成形、辐射进空间、再到达远端」的完整旅程，分四章把射频与天线设计讲成一个连贯整体，而非孤立知识点的堆叠。\n\n第一章「射频基础」打地基：从传输线与阻抗匹配建立「波会反射」的根本直觉，引出描述网络的通用语言 S 参数，再用史密斯圆图把这些抽象计算变成可视化的几何操作。这三者是后面一切的共同词汇——匹配、$S_{11}$、圆图会反复出现在每一章。\n\n第二章「射频电路」处理信号：放大器在收发两端镜像对立（LNA 求最低噪声、PA 求最高效率），混频器与振荡器负责频率的搬运与参考，滤波器守住频域边界。它们都建立在第一章的匹配与 S 参数之上，是把微弱或成形信号「处理干净」的环节。\n\n第三章「天线原理」把电流变成波：先建立衡量天线的参数体系（增益、方向图、极化、带宽），再梳理各类天线形态的取舍，最后用阵列与波束成形——这一现代射频的明珠——讲清如何电调相位让波束随意指向，这正是毫米波时代不可或缺的能力。\n\n第四章「系统与应用」收口落地：链路预算把前三章的零件拼成一本能量账，回答「信号到底够不够用」；电磁兼容确保系统不互相干扰；现代无线系统与毫米波则把全部知识映射到 2026 年真实部署的 5G、WiFi 7、低轨卫星与 6G 研究上。\n\n四章层层递进：基础给词汇，电路处理信号，天线辐射能量，系统把一切算平并落到产品。读完你将拥有的不是一堆零散公式，而是一张能从一根传输线一路想到一座毫米波基站的完整图景。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rf-fundamentals","title":"射频基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/rf-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transmission-line-matching","title":"传输线与阻抗匹配","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/rf-fundamentals/transmission-line-matching"},{"seq":2,"slug":"s-parameters","title":"S 参数与散射","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/rf-fundamentals/s-parameters"},{"seq":3,"slug":"smith-chart","title":"史密斯圆图","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/rf-fundamentals/smith-chart"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"rf-circuits","title":"射频电路","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/rf-circuits","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lna-pa","title":"低噪声放大器与功放","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/rf-circuits/lna-pa"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mixer-oscillator","title":"混频器与振荡器","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/rf-circuits/mixer-oscillator"},{"seq":3,"slug":"filter-design","title":"射频滤波器设计","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/rf-circuits/filter-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"antennas","title":"天线原理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/antennas","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"antenna-parameters","title":"天线基本参数","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/antennas/antenna-parameters"},{"seq":2,"slug":"antenna-types","title":"常见天线类型","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/antennas/antenna-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"arrays-beamforming","title":"天线阵列与波束成形","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/antennas/arrays-beamforming"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"systems","title":"系统与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"link-budget-noise","title":"链路预算与噪声","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/systems/link-budget-noise"},{"seq":2,"slug":"emc-shielding","title":"电磁兼容与屏蔽","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/systems/emc-shielding"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-wireless","title":"现代无线系统与毫米波","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/systems/modern-wireless"}]}]}